<section class="aq-section aq-record-slips-sec"><div class="aq-in aq-stack-l"><header class="aq-sec-head"><h2 class="aq-h1">Each process, and the record it leaves</h2></header><div class="aq-record-slips"><div class="aq-record-slips__cols" aria-hidden="true"><span>Process</span><span>Record you can inspect</span></div><div class="aq-fold" id="fold-1"><ol class="aq-record-slips__list" role="list"><li class="aq-record-slips__row" style="--i:0"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Change control</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Impact assessed before work continues; your approval for documents you approved</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Change request with impact assessment</span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Change control register</span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="aq-record-slips__row" style="--i:1"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Nonconformance and complaints</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Items held and decided; repeat, systemic or client-reported causes get a corrective and preventive action (CAPA)</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Nonconformance report (NCR)</span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>CAPA with effectiveness check</span></li><li style="--j:2"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Complaint log</span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="aq-record-slips__row" style="--i:2"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Identification and traceability</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Product-contact parts traced by lot or serial number to joint and drawing</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Material log against <span class="aq-ph">[PP material certificates]</span></span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="aq-ph">[PP joint records kept]</span></span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="aq-record-slips__row aq-fold-x" style="--i:3"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Calibration</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Traceable to national standards through <span class="aq-ph">[calibration provider and accreditation held]</span>; an out-of-tolerance result reopens every reading since the last calibration</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Calibration register</span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>As-found and as-left certificates</span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="aq-record-slips__row aq-fold-x" style="--i:4"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">05</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Document control</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Only the current approved revision issued; superseded ones withdrawn and kept</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Document register</span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Client comment logs</span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="aq-record-slips__row aq-fold-x" style="--i:5"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">06</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Supplier control</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Product-contact and special-process suppliers approved before use, reviewed on a schedule</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Approved supplier list</span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Incoming inspection records</span></li></ul></div></div></li><li class="aq-record-slips__row aq-fold-x" style="--i:6"><div class="aq-record-slips__proc"><span class="aq-index" aria-hidden="true">07</span><h3 class="aq-record-slips__name">Internal audit and management review</h3><p class="aq-record-slips__k">What it controls</p><p class="aq-record-slips__ctl">Each process audited by someone independent of it; results reviewed by management</p></div><div class="aq-record-slips__feed"><span class="aq-record-slips__slot" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="aq-record-slips__slip" data-theme="light"><p class="aq-record-slips__k">Record you can inspect</p><ul class="aq-record-slips__recs" role="list"><li style="--j:0"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Audit reports</span></li><li style="--j:1"><span class="aq-record-slips__box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Management review minutes</span></li></ul></div></div></li></ol><button type="button" class="aq-fold__btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="fold-1" data-more="Show all 7 processes">Show all 7 processes</button></div></div></div></section>
